      "question": "A bike starts from rest and reaches a velocity of 12 m/s in 4 seconds with uniform acceleration. Find its acceleration.",
      "options": {
        "A": "3 m/s²",
        "B": "4 m/s²",
        "C": "48 m/s²",
        "D": "2 m/s²"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "Acceleration a = (v - u) / t = (12 - 0) / 4 = 3 m/s².",
      "explanation_short": "a = (12 - 0) / 4 = 3 m/s².",
      "explanation_pidgin": "Divide change in speed (12) by time (4), acceleration na 3 m/s²."
